{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38008","headline":"湖南梅花一冬再发偶题於花援 · 韩偓","name":"湖南梅花一冬再发偶题於花援","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘浦梅花两度开，直应天意别栽培。\n玉爲通体依稀见，香号返魂容易回。\n寒气与君霜里退，阳和爲尔腊前来。\n夭桃莫倚东风势，调鼎何曾用不材。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}